  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <head>Cēṉāvaraiyar</head>
        <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Ci. Vai. Tamōtarampiḷḷai</persName> 1868, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/tolkppiyamcollat00unse/page/n94/mode/1up">91</ref>–<ref target="https://archive.org/details/tolkppiyamcollat00unse/page/n95/mode/1up">92</ref>.</p>
      <p>i-ḷ. piṇṭattaiyuṇarttum peyarum mutaṟciṉaip peyariyalpiṟṟiriyā; avvāṟu avaṟṟai mutaluñciṉaiyumāka vaḻaṅkutal mēṟṟoṭṭu vaḻaṅki vārāniṉṟa kūṟṟāṉ maruviya muṟai. e-ṟu.</p>
      <p>piṇṭam palaporuṭṭokuti</p>
      <p>īṇṭu āyiyaṟiriyāveṉa māṭṭeṟintatu, mutaṟciṉaik kiḷavikkupōlap piṇṭappeyarkku mutaṟkaṇ āṟāvatu variṟ ciṉaikku iraṇṭāvatu varutalum, mutaṟku iraṇṭāvatu variṟ ciṉaikku ēḻāvatu varutalum, ciṟupāṉmai iraṇṭāvatu varutalumām.</p>
      <p>u-m. kuppaiyatu talaiyayc citaṟiṉāṉ; kuppaiyayt talaikkaṭcitaṟiṉāṉ; kuppaiyayt talaiyayc citaṟiṉāṉ eṉa varum.</p>
      <p>piṇṭāmum mutaluñciṉaiyumēyākaliṉ vēṟu kūṟalvēṇṭāveṉiṉ;- kuppaiyeṉpuḻi, tokka palaporuḷallatu, avaṟṟiṉ vēṟāy avaṟṟāṉiyaṉṟu taṉoṉṟeṉappaṭum poruliṉmaiyiṉ, tollāciriyar ataṉai mutaleṉṟu vēṇṭār; ataṉāṉ vēṟu kūṟiṉāreṉpatu. paṭaikāṭu kā mutalāyiṉavumaṉṉa.</p>
      </body>
  </text>
